# P41 through GtkBackend: the wheel and the clock drawn in SwiftCrossUI views, and GTK's own rows.
#
# The GtkBackend twin of P41-swift-wheel-rows-clock.actions. Here the wheel (_SwiftWheelDatePicker)
# and the clock (_SwiftClockDatePicker) are SwiftCrossUI views and the rows are GTK spin buttons
# (nativeTimePresentation = .rows). The readback under each cell is the binding; with --debug each
# change is also a "<cell label> -> <value>" line in p41-debug-events.log. Start: 2025-08-24 09:46:40.
#
# origin=frame, window 1340 x 888 points, capture scale 1 (p41-macos-gtk4-final-20261020-221856.png).
#
